WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.056 --> 00:00:11.064
Hair set with countless bobby pins and strong-hold spray can be damaged if you force it apart.

2
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:19.272
First, find and remove the main pins and hair ornament holding the bun in place.

3
00:00:19.608 --> 00:00:26.208
Once the hairpiece comes off, slowly remove the remaining bobby pins one by one.

4
00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:38.280
Don't brush hair stiffened by spray while dry — wet it thoroughly with lukewarm water, apply plenty of conditioner or treatment to dissolve the residue, and let it sit,

5
00:00:38.616 --> 00:00:44.256
then shampoo afterward for smooth, tangle-free removal.
